# horcrux stones — vant stego horcruxes are ONE 800 KB+ line of base64
# ciphertext; any line-oriented search match echoes the whole wall and
# starves the result budget (prime #100). ripgrep-family tools honor this
# file, git does NOT — the stones stay tracked and committed for disaster
# recovery. Use `vant horcrux inspect <stone>` to see contents; never grep.
models/public/*/boot/*.svg
horcrux/*.svg
